<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets call warrants on H-shares basket.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on H-shares basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland Hong Kong Branch said on Thursday it has issued 200 million American-style call warrants on a basket of eight locally-listed Chinese enterprises H-shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd		 0.5 shares</p>
<p> Guangshen Railway Co Ltd			0.4 shares</p>
<p> Maanshan Iron and Steel Co Ltd		0.7 shares</p>
<p> Jilin Chemical Industrial Co Ltd	    0.8 shares</p>
<p> Tsingtao Brewery Co Ltd			 0.3 shares</p>
<p> Yizheng Chemical Fibre Co Ltd		 0.7 shares</p>
<p> Anhui Expressway Co Ltd			 0.5 shares</p>
<p> Qingling Motors Ltd			     0.3 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$9.6535	PREMIUM	    28.13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.2715	GEARING	    3.55x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  09.JAN.98	EXER LOT	   10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT DATE  27.JAN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$9.6535	LISTING DATE     30.JAN 97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
